Package: dwhr
Type: Package
Title: Interactive Shiny Dashboards Over Star-Schema Data Warehouse Data
Version: 1.6.2
Authors@R: c(
    person("Pieter", "Timmerman", role = "aut",
           comment = "original author, in memoriam"),
    person("Howard", "Ching Chung", , "howardchingchung@protonmail.com",
           role = c("cre", "aut")))
Description: Provides a framework for building interactive Shiny dashboards
    over star-schema data warehouse data. Users construct a 'star' object
    from a facts table, dimension views, measures, and presentation
    specifications; the package handles the reactive plumbing between
    drillable hierarchical dimensions and DataTable, Highcharts, and form
    control presentations. Note: the Highcharts presentation type is rendered
    via the 'highcharter' package, which redistributes the Highcharts JS
    library under its own license; commercial deployment of dashboards may
    require a Highcharts commercial license — see
    <https://www.highcharts.com/license>.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
